    "body": "## What\n\nReplace the fork's lint/type-only Woodpecker pipeline with native ARM64 checks, native-addon and CLI builds, full TS/Rust tests, and a compiled-binary smoke run. Use the dedicated repo-restricted agent with persistent Bun download and Cargo download/compilation caches on the ARM box.\n\n## Why\n\nPRs previously merged without exercising native changes or the built CLI. This runs those checks before merge without x86 emulation or workstation compilation.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Strict Woodpecker configuration lint passed.\n- The dedicated ARM image was run on the box: Bun, Rust, GCC, and nextest report ARM64; the 50 GB cache volume is mounted and the agent is running.\n- Full PR checks: pending this PR. Local project compilation intentionally skipped as requested; this change is internal CI configuration, so no user-facing changelog entry applies.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] `bun check` passes\n- [ ] Tested locally\n- [ ] CHANGELOG updated with the required attribution (if user-facing; internal issue fixes use issue links, external contributions add the PR link and contributor credit after creation)",
